# Deny everything, then re-admit the two directories the image actually needs. An allowlist rather
# than a list of exclusions, because the expensive things here — node_modules, coverage,
# playwright-report, test-results — are exactly the ones somebody forgets to add to a denylist.
#
# The image contains no build step, so the source tree is not part of the context at all: `dist/`
# is produced by `npm run build` before the image is built. See the Dockerfile header.
*
!dist
!docker
